  Slug: school-of-protean-form
  DisplayName: School of Protean Form
  IconPath: icons/sundries/books/book-embossed-jewel-silver-green.webp
  Description: 'The uninitiated often think of wizards as cerebral, focused on their
    studies more than the body, yet your school of magic taught of the relationship
    between the two. Your magic, whether learned at a storied institution like Kintargo''s
    Alabaster Academy or someplace more sinister, like the Fleshforges of Nex, focuses
    on the ways that living matter can be convinced into another shape for a time,
    allowing you to polymorph a seed into a vine, a human into a beast, or a harmless
    germ into a deadly toxin. Curriculum cantrips: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Gouging
    Claw], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Tangle Vine] 1st: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Jump],
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Pest Form], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Spider
    Sting] 2nd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Enlarge], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Humanoid
    Form] 3rd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Feet to Fins], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Vampiric
    Feast] 4th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mountain Resilience], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Vapor
    Form] 5th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Elemental Form], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Toxic
    Cloud] 6th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Cursed Metamorphosis], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Petrify]
    7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Duplicate Foe], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Fiery
    Body] 8th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Desiccate], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Monstrosity
    Form] 9th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Metamorphosis] School Spells
    initial: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Scramble Body]; advanced: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Shifting
    Form]'
